  <p><b><u><font size=4>Hind roti thi</font></u></b></p>
  <b><u><font size=4> </font></u></b>
  <p><font size=4>Haaye baap ki yaad sakina ko jo tarapti thi</font></p>
  <font size=4> <p>Waa hussaina ki sada deke wo chillati thi</p> <p>Ye sada hind ke kaanose jo takrati thi</p> <p>Are hind zindan ke darwaze pe ajati thi</p> <p>hind zindan ke darwaze pe ajati thi</p> 
   <ol>
    <li>usne ik din kaneezo(n) se puchha</li>
    <p>kuchh batawo(n) ke hai majra kya</p>
    <p>kiski rone ki hai ye sadaaye(n)</p>
    <p>kon zinda(n) me karta hai nawha</p>
    <p>hind roti thi zinda(n) ki darpar ik yateema ki awaz sunkar</p>
    <p>hind roti thi zinda(n) ki darpar</p>
    <li>al gharaz agayi zindan talak mehve bukaa</li>
    <p>parh ke zinadaan ke darbano ne dar khol diya</p>
    <p>baabe zindaan me dakhil jo huwi wo dukhiya</p>
