    <p>apne sine se usko lagaya</p>
    <p>ponch kar aashk bachhi se puchha</p>
    <p>kyu(n) hai nawha tera wa hussaina</p>
    <p>naam badlade apne padar ka</p>
    <p>hind roti thi zinda(n) me aakar ik yateema ki awaz sunkar</p>
    <p>hind roti thi zinda(n) aakar</p>
    <li>hind ne puchha watan usne kaha bewatani</li>
    <p>kaam jab hind ne puchha to kaha sina zani</p>
    <p>jurm jab puchha to wo boli ghareebul watani</p>
    <p>are (dard jab puchha to kehne lagi eeza rasani) x2</p>
    <p>hind ne puchha kabse ho qaydi</p>
    <p>peet ke sar ko boli wo bachhi</p>
    <p>saal bhar qayd me yu(n) ghuzaara</p>
    <p>na dawa hai na marham hai koyi</p>
    <p>hind roti thi zinda(n) me aakar ik yateema ki awaz sunkar</p>
    <p>hind roti thi zinda(n) aakar</p>
    <li>hind ne puchha maraz kya hai kaha bepadari</li>
    <p>roke wo boli dawa kya hai kaha nawha ghari</p>
